{"version":1,"content":"<p>面對美國試圖進一步插手阿斯麥（ASML）對華業務，荷蘭政府再次公開表達不滿。<strong>荷蘭外交大臣貝倫德森在訪問北京期間表示，荷蘭政府正努力阻止美國通過一項可能進一步限制阿斯麥在華業務的法案。</strong></p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1588168.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T04:37:49.353120+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":97,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T04:20:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T04:31:11.412630+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T04:31:11.412630+00:00","content_hash":"8c4e964f41c63670dcbc41ff39ea0adfdcc1a943e1df6edde7c3d00d9be420ee","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}